#retrieve
###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/book/1/
Accept: application/json

#update
###
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/book/1/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    
    "id": 1,
    "title": "Lost Symbol",
    "author": "Dan Brown",
    "pages": 200,
    "price": "150.00",
    "genre": "Crime Thriller"
  
}

#delete
###
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/book/1/
Accept: application/json
